        "description": "<p><span>\n\nOur kids like listening to music on their tablets, and we decided it's\nworth it to pay some money so they can make playlists and don't need\nto listen to ads.  A family account makes sense if you're more than\none person, and we ended up with Amazon somewhat randomly.  I've been\npoking around: the personalization features are pretty terrible, and\nthey have a major artist conflation problem.\n\n</span>\n\n<p>\n\nWhen you first show up it asks you to pick some artists to seed your\nexperience with.  I put in the first few bands that came to mind:\n\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.jefftk.com/amazon-music-seed-bands-big.png\"><img src=\"https://www.jefftk.com/amazon-music-seed-bands.png\" alt=\"Airdance, The Free Raisins,\nCrowfoot, Perpetual e-Motion, Great Bear, Kingfisher, Buddy System\" width=\"550\" height=\"224\" class=\"mobile-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:100.0vw; max-height:40.7vw;\" srcset=\"https://www.jefftk.com/amazon-music-seed-bands.png 550w,https://www.jefftk.com/amazon-music-seed-bands",
